   "widgets_values": [
    "Wide cinematic shot on a 35mm lens. A lone stone lighthouse on black rock at the edge of a dark northern sea, lamp turning slowly in heavy dusk. Storm swell breaks white against the tower. Initially the beam sweeps away across low cloud. A moment later it rotates back toward the lens and washes the wet rock in pale gold. The camera drifts slowly right, one steady unbroken move. Cold blue grey light with the lamp as the only warm source. Audio: heavy surf on rock, wind across stone, a distant foghorn."
